WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:25.072
Peter opened the door.

2
00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:28.272
Flopsy stood there.

3
00:00:28.273 --> 00:00:31.508
She stared at the mess.

4
00:00:31.509 --> 00:00:35.264
"Where is Mrs. Tiggywinkle?" she asked.

5
00:00:35.265 --> 00:00:38.417
Peter wiped soap from his eyes.

6
00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:41.508
"She is on a holiday," he said.

7
00:00:41.509 --> 00:00:46.505
"We are washing the clothes today," Benjamin said.

8
00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:50.814
"Can you wash my red dress?" Flopsy said.

9
00:00:50.815 --> 00:00:55.458
"I need it for a party."

10
00:00:55.459 --> 00:01:01.217
"Um . . ." Peter tried to say no.

11
00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:03.532
But Flopsy waved.

12
00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:12.021
"Thank you! Good-bye!"

13
00:01:12.022 --> 00:01:15.119
Benjamin stomped his foot.

14
00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:22.251
"We will never fly my kite!"

15
00:01:22.252 --> 00:01:28.584
Flopsy hopped down the hill.

16
00:01:28.585 --> 00:01:36.200
Mrs. Tiggywinkle was sitting in the sun.

17
00:01:36.201 --> 00:01:39.759
Mrs. Tiggywinkle waved. "Hello!

18
00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:44.183
I'm on a lovely holiday."

19
00:01:44.184 --> 00:01:47.076
"I know," Flopsy said.

20
00:01:47.077 --> 00:01:50.741
"Peter and Benjamin are washing the clothes."

21
00:01:50.742 --> 00:01:55.334
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gasped. "What?"

22
00:01:55.335 --> 00:01:59.249
"They will wash my red dress," Flopsy said.

23
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.584
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gulped.

24
00:02:02.585 --> 00:02:07.060
"They are making a big mess," Flopsy said.

25
00:02:07.061 --> 00:02:10.761
"There was lots of soap and water."

26
00:02:10.762 --> 00:02:14.431
Mrs. Tiggywinkle leaped up.

27
00:02:14.432 --> 00:02:19.583
She ran home fast.
